scope one REDS row recording a fault two ships found at once; my own cure withdrawn in favour of a peer's better one; three living pages carrying the seat's claim moved to cite the mechanism that landed; no tool change ships
status GREEN, and honestly smaller than it opened -- the tool change withdrew and what ships is the record plus the prose. convergence_census, convergence_prove, convergence_tree_prove, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_pin_capacity, reds_spine_derive, reds_citation, unshared_citation, ascii_document, living_docs_lint, fold_shelf_link, shelf_link_touch, living_pin_near_bound and pin_bound_touch all green; cold roster 205/201, its 2 reds the parked pair under %636 and neither mine
recommend keep-going -- the denominator is the next question, and it is untouched by either cure: dated_path_exclusions is a sourced library rather than a writer, so the census counts a candidate nobody runs twice
